        <mxCell id="hnpdLIrYYvueMlUQwmrZ-447" parent="hnpdLIrYYvueMlUQwmrZ-445" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#FFFFFF);top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#000000);fontSize=24;align=left;" value="&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;FMC&#39;s commercial HfO₂ memory (Dresden/NaMLab origin, CEA-Leti-endorsed) may align with the BEOL-integrated lineage rather than the Okuno/CUB lineage this drOWLing models, the two shouldn&#39;t be merged without confirming which specific process FMC actually uses.&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
